 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 that pair landed at 41% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 218% of normal and March to April at 49%. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1954, with grid 14582 at 55%.</p>"}
